    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The potential of three-dimensional (3D) printing to transform healthcare and medical education has led to Kenyan hospitals setting up their own in-house facilities, according to speakers at the 3D Printing in Healthcare Symposium hosted by Aga Khan University Hospital and Aga Khan University, in Nairobi.",
